                                Materials and Earth Sciences. See `R. Hielscher et al.
                                <https://mtex-toolbox.github.io/publications>`_ and the `MTex source
                                code <https://github.com/mtex-toolbox>`_ for details.
                  NXparameters
                    Doc       : Container for parameters used in processing or analysing data.
                                Typically, this group is stored in a :ref:`NXprocess` group in order
                                to contain parameters that are either inputs to or resulting from
                                the process defined by the parent group. However, this base class
                                can also be added to other groups for use in other contexts.
                                Although this base class can be used to store any kind of parameter,
                                one possible use case is to store parameters that are refined by a
                                fitting function or model. A number of attributes have been defined
                                to store metadata associated with such a refinement.

